    "date": 1757921218,
    "caption": "🏆 Demo Booth Winner at S-TRON Shanghai 2025!\n\nAs an official community partner of S-TRON Shanghai 2025, the Khan Tengri Innovation Hub offered a unique opportunity for one Central Asian startup to win a FREE demo booth (valued at $1,000) right next to the main pitch stage. 🚀\n\nAfter strong competition and a careful review process, one startup truly stood out — BrainPatch.AI! 🎉\n\nTheir innovative solution — an e-Meditation Smart Space for emotional reset, inspiration, and inner balance restoration — deeply impressed the selection committee. 💡✨\n\n📌 As a bonus, BrainPatch.AI will also receive complimentary accommodation in Shanghai, courtesy of the Khan Tengri Innovation Hub.\n\nWe can’t wait to see them showcase their groundbreaking product this September, alongside the world’s top innovators! 🌍\n\n📍 When: September 23–24, 2025\n📍 Where: West Bund Art Center, Shanghai",
